  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Work and protection of Human Rights Defenders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the work of Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) and enhance their protection. The project proposes interventions that will help encourage State officers to respect and protect human rights and HRDs, positively influence how the public view the work of HRDs and in order to support it and enhance the ability of HRDs to employ the existing redress mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
